-creator, mc-publisher, mc-wp-publisher, mc-chart-generator)\nSessions listed: 5\nFiltered to last 5 minute(s)\nAgent      Kind   Key                        Age       Model          Tokens (ctx %)       Flags\nmain       direct agent:main:main            just now  gemini-3.5-flash 11k/128k (8%)        system id:a55fd4f6-78bd-401c-8eb9-bb040999d5bd\norchestrator direct agent:orchestrator:main    1m ago    gemini-3.1-pro-preview 15k/200k (8%)        id:57335459-136d-4a2c-a1ef-0bf4739fe1f8\nresearcher direct agent:researcher...e29d72  1m ago    gemini-3.5-flash unknown/128k (?%)    id:67991af6-94e8-4736-959a-5783ff24f4f7\nmain       direct agent:main:teleg...449303  4m ago    gemini-3.5-flash 40k/128k (31%)       system id:8726ed77-ce62-4ca7-81f1-d131201150eb\nmain       direct agent:main:subag...43f0c3  4m ago    gemini-3.5-flash unknown/128k (?%)    id:61439bda-dbf9-42ff-badb-b12afe16e2bb\n\n\nProcess exited with code 0."}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780390662714,"__openclaw":{"id":"fdd2e456","seq":71}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"tail -n 50 /home/bhard/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780390662717,"responseId":"CZseaqvcMPWD694P_7zqkQ8","__openclaw":{"id":"fb9d284e","seq":72}},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"tail: cannot open '/home/bhard/.openclaw/logs/gateway.log' for reading: No such file or directory\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780390665128,"__openclaw":{"id":"ab494a74","seq":73}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/bhard/.openclaw/logs/"}}],"api":"opena