{"type":"message","id":"5fa4e4a1","parentId":"4701538e","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:03:24.209Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 44\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 bhard bhard 4096 Jun  1 05:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 bhard bhard 4096 May  5 05:25 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 bhard bhard 2556 Jun  2 06:16 SKILL.md\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 7887 Jun  2 08:50 generate.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 8863 May 18 13:36 generate.sh.bak.1779111383\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 8337 May 26 07:28 generate.sh.bak.leonardo"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"total 44\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 bhard bhard 4096 Jun  1 05:30 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 bhard bhard 4096 May  5 05:25 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 bhard bhard 2556 Jun  2 06:16 SKILL.md\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 7887 Jun  2 08:50 generate.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 8863 May 18 13:36 generate.sh.bak.1779111383\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 bhard bhard 8337 May 26 07:28 generate.sh.bak.leonardo","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780391004209}}
{"type":"message","id":"fadb351b","parentId":"5fa4e4a1","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:03:26.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":4777,"output":32,"cacheRead":46154,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50963,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780391004210,"responseId":"X5weao2DC9HrjNAPp-Wp-AY"}}
{"type":"message","id":"790d2d03","parentId":"fadb351b","timestamp":"2026-06-02T09:03:26.052Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: generate-image\n\n## What This Skill Does\nGenerates a photorealistic editorial feature image using **Vertex Imagen 4** via the local **Bifrost** gateway, saves it locally, and optionally watermarks it with the brand logo.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"<YOUR PROMPT>\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"Medium shot of focused male trader at multi-screen desk, Bitcoin chart on background monitor, dark professional office, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\n```\n\n## Environment Variables (optional)\n\n| Variable | Default | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| `BIFROST_BASE_URL` | `http://172.30.176.1:8888/v1` | Bifrost OpenAI-compatible API base |\n| `IMAGE_MODEL` | `vertex/imagen-4.0-fast-generate-001` | Primary (fast, ~5–8s) |\n| `IMAGE_MODEL_FALLBACK` | `vertex/imagen-4.0-generate-001` | Quality fallback if primary fails |\n| `STAMP_LOGO` | `1` | Set `0` to skip Coinography logo composite |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning | Where to Read Result |\n|-----------|---------|----------------------|\n| `0` (success) | Image generated and saved | `cat /tmp/image-result.txt` |\n| `1` (failure) | Something went wrong | `cat /tmp/image-error.log` |\n\n## What the Script Handles Automatically\n- Bifrost `POST /v1/images/generations` → Vertex Imagen 4\n- Primary model then fast fallback per retry round\n- Editorial negative constraints appended to prompt (no text/watermark/illustration)\n- Up to 3 retry rounds with exponential backoff\n- Single-response base64 decode (no async polling or CDN download)\n- Symlink-safe write to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg`\n- Optional logo stamp (100px, bottom-right)\n- Expect **5–10 seconds** per successful generation (Imagen 4 Fast primary)\n\n## What YOU Must Do (Your Only Job)\n1. Read the article title and topic from the message you received.\n2. Craft a **medium-shot** editorial prompt using the rules in your SOUL.md.\n3. Call this script with that prompt.\n4. Read the result:\n   - If exit code 0: Return `cat /tmp/image-result.txt`\n   - If exit code 1: Return `IMAGE_FAILED: ` + `cat /tmp/image-error.log`\n\n## Important Notes\n- The prompt must be under 1000 characters.\n- Do NOT include any text, logos, or written words in your prompt description.\n- The image will always be saved to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` (1024×576 resolution).\n- Do NOT call Bifrost or Vertex directly — always use this script."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":11,"aggregated":"# Skill: generate-image\n\n## What This Skill Does\nGenerates a photorealistic editorial feature image using **Vertex Imagen 4** via the local **Bifrost** gateway, saves it locally, and optionally watermarks it with the brand logo.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"<YOUR PROMPT>\"\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-creator/skills/generate-image/generate.sh \"Medium shot of focused male trader at multi-screen desk, Bitcoin chart on background monitor, dark professional office, editorial press photography, Reuters style, photorealistic, DSLR, 35mm lens, sharp focus, candid\"\n```\n\n## Environment Variables (optional)\n\n| Variable | Default | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|---------|\n| `BIFROST_BASE_URL` | `http://172.30.176.1:8888/v1` | Bifrost OpenAI-compatible API base |\n| `IMAGE_MODEL` | `vertex/imagen-4.0-fast-generate-001` | Primary (fast, ~5–8s) |\n| `IMAGE_MODEL_FALLBACK` | `vertex/imagen-4.0-generate-001` | Quality fallback if primary fails |\n| `STAMP_LOGO` | `1` | Set `0` to skip Coinography logo composite |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning | Where to Read Result |\n|-----------|---------|----------------------|\n| `0` (success) | Image generated and saved | `cat /tmp/image-result.txt` |\n| `1` (failure) | Something went wrong | `cat /tmp/image-error.log` |\n\n## What the Script Handles Automatically\n- Bifrost `POST /v1/images/generations` → Vertex Imagen 4\n- Primary model then fast fallback per retry round\n- Editorial negative constraints appended to prompt (no text/watermark/illustration)\n- Up to 3 retry rounds with exponential backoff\n- Single-response base64 decode (no async polling or CDN download)\n- Symlink-safe write to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg`\n- Optional logo stamp (100px, bottom-right)\n- Expect **5–10 seconds** per successful generation (Imagen 4 Fast primary)\n\n## What YOU Must Do (Your Only Job)\n1. Read the article title and topic from the message you received.\n2. Craft a **medium-shot** editorial prompt using the rules in your SOUL.md.\n3. Call this script with that prompt.\n4. Read the result:\n   - If exit code 0: Return `cat /tmp/image-result.txt`\n   - If exit code 1: Return `IMAGE_FAILED: ` + `cat /tmp/image-error.log`\n\n## Important Notes\n- The prompt must be under 1000 characters.\n- Do NOT include any text, logos, or written words in your prompt description.\n- The image will always be saved to `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` (1024×576 resolution).\n- Do NOT call Bifrost or Vertex directly — always use this script.","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780391006052}}
