rified that the URLs return live HTTP status codes (200).\\n- **Facts Extracted & Aggregated**: Pulled deep content from CoinTelegraph, Decrypt, and CryptoFox using `trafilatura` to construct a robust aggregated raw text pool (exceeding 750 words) and extracted core key facts (Pavel Durov's MTGA 7-step roadmap, 3-week transition timeline, zero-swap technical continuity, and price impact details).\\n- **JSON Output Generated**: Built and formatted the structured payload to the target file path `/tmp/crypto-run-20260602-085601/research/raw.json` (and mirrored to `/tmp/researcher-raw.txt`).\\n\\nSUCCESS\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.2\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"openclaw\",\"date\":\"2026-06-02T08:57:43.430Z\",\"logLevelId\":3,\"logLevelName\":\"INFO\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160:46\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160\",\"fileColumn\":\"46\",\"fileLine\":\"160\",\"filePath\":\"/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js\",\"filePathWithLine\":\"/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:160\"}},\"time\":\"2026-06-02T08:57:43.430+00:00\"}\n{\"0\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"tools\\\"}\",\"1\":\"tools.profile (coding) allowlist contains unknown entries (nodes, gateway). These entries are shipped core tools but unavailable in the current runtime/provider/model/config.\",\"_meta\":{\"runtime\":\"node\",\"runtimeVersion\":\"22.22.2\",\"hostname\":\"unknown\",\"name\":\"{\\\"subsystem\\\":\\\"tools\\\"}\",\"parentNames\":[\"openclaw\"],\"date\":\"2026-06-02T08:57:44.948Z\",\"logLevelId\":4,\"logLevelName\":\"WARN\",\"path\":{\"fullFilePath\":\"file:///home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:338:14\",\"fileName\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js\",\"fileNameWithLine\":\"subsystem-bmJ5rL4Q.js:338\",\"fileCo